<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email - Turf Management</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 0; }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #065f46 100%); padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .header-icon { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-top: 8px; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .message { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .otp-wrapper { margin: 32px 0; text-align: center; }
        .otp-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .otp-container { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ecfdf5, #d1fae5); border: 2px solid #6ee7b7; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 48px; }
        .otp-code { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: #065f46; letter-spacing: 10px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; }
        .expiry-badge { display: inline-block; background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fcd34d; border-radius: 20px; padding: 6px 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #92400e; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 16px; }
        .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 32px 0; }
        .warning { font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { padding: 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
        .footer-brand { font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-icon">📧</div>
                <div class="header-title">Verify Your Email</div>
                <div class="header-subtitle">One step away from getting started</div>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="greeting">Welcome to Turf Management, <%= name %>!</div>
                <p class="message">
                    Thanks for signing up! Please use the verification code below to confirm your email address and activate your account.
                </p>
                <div class="otp-wrapper">
                    <div class="otp-label">Your Verification Code</div>
                    <div class="otp-container">
                        <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="expiry-badge">⏱ Expires in <%= expiresIn %> minutes</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <hr class="divider">
                <p class="warning">
                    If you did not create an account with Turf Management, you can safely ignore this email. This code will expire automatically.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <div class="footer-brand">Turf Booking System</div>
                &copy; 2026 All rights reserved. &bull; Powered by Turf Management Platform
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
